{"4671450": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "World of Slime", "steam_appid": 4671450, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4793900], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671450/extras/06a447f415d7384d49b33e8027243a86.webp?t=1787735051\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671450/extras/06a447f415d7384d49b33e8027243a86.poster.avif?t=1787735051\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1170 height=240 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>One day, mutant slimes suddenly appeared before mankind!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671450/extras/0495bc4c56bee5038407814de7d31157.avif?t=1787735051\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671450/extras_big/0495bc4c56bee5038407814de7d31157.avif?t=1787735051 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>World of Slime</strong> is a casual adventure MMORPG where you explore with your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture and synthesize chewy, gooey slimes to discover new ones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventure with your partner slime as you hunt other slimes and overcome obstacles,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >solve problems for slimes and various NPCs, and slowly uncover the secrets of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671450/extras/06f5add6ad068dadd24fc033d8134fcb.avif?t=1787735051\" width=1170 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671450/extras/852c8590ab05ed32c3795ad8d2c721ac.poster.avif?t=1787735051\" width=1170 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671450/extras/852c8590ab05ed32c3795ad8d2c721ac.webm?t=1787735051\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671450/extras/852c8590ab05ed32c3795ad8d2c721ac.mp4?t=1787735051\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >People in the World of Slime have gathered in villages to stay safe from the wild slimes that suddenly appeared.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can help people using their special power to capture slimes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special slimes that have formed a bond with you can move as you wish or help clear obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671450/extras/a7b721f794403dc93c10f3c3c4e4e08d.avif?t=1787735051\" width=1170 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671450/extras/a2397e2d943724811c90f64f196b10be.poster.avif?t=1787735051\" width=1170 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671450/extras/a2397e2d943724811c90f64f196b10be.webm?t=1787735051\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671450/extras/a2397e2d943724811c90f64f196b10be.mp4?t=1787735051\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Record the new slimes you meet on your adventure in your Slimepedia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you capture more slimes or strengthen your bonds to build knowledge,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you can learn skills that make your adventure easier or unlock stronger hidden functions within your slimes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Studying slimes is just as important as leveling them up, so keep exploring their secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671450/extras/02bd97c188742f0a3d35c9264216eb57.avif?t=1787735051\" width=1170 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671450/extras/664a1d7854ff7b5def84601fc814d7c5.poster.avif?t=1787735051\" width=1170 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671450/extras/664a1d7854ff7b5def84601fc814d7c5.webm?t=1787735051\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671450/extras/664a1d7854ff7b5def84601fc814d7c5.mp4?t=1787735051\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore different locations in the World of Slime with your slime companions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ride a slime to swim or have one pull a sled to reach places you could never get to on foot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt powerful slimes hiding deep within the world, or capture them and make them your allies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you help the various NPCs you meet on your journey, the secrets of the world will slowly be revealed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671450/extras/25cc8f82bf6d81d8831f685f78a0a4a1.avif?t=1787735051\" width=1170 height=140 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671450/extras/96c87255525ad61bf72cba731405f305.poster.avif?t=1787735051\" width=1170 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671450/extras/96c87255525ad61bf72cba731405f305.webm?t=1787735051\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671450/extras/96c87255525ad61bf72cba731405f305.mp4?t=1787735051\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make new friends in the World of Slime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore this cute world together and share information with your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create stronger, more unique parties and claim victory in 1v1 or team PvP battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671450/extras/76681bccc91aeb121666ce43c6ece487.webp?t=1787735051\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671450/extras/76681bccc91aeb121666ce43c6ece487.poster.avif?t=1787735051\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1170 height=486 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671450/extras/06a447f415d7384d49b33e8027243a86.webp?t=1787735051\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store